name: goods-price-comparison-deployer
description: Tekton deployer for goods-price-comparison-service — service-specific CI/CD pipeline, tasks, and RBAC for shared dev-infrastructure
version: 1.0.0

technologies:
  - Tekton Pipelines
  - Kubernetes
  - k3d
  - Docker
  - Kaniko
  - Maven
  - Shell scripting

workflows:
  - k8s-expert
  - docker-expert
  - kind-expert

capabilities:
  - Tekton pipeline and task definitions
  - Kubernetes RBAC and namespace management
  - Container image builds with Kaniko
  - Maven build and test automation
  - CI/CD integration with shared infrastructure
